{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國《福布斯》雜誌官網當地時間11月9日報道稱，英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳承認婚外情一事後，外界開始猜測他與妻子洛麗·黃（Lori Huang）或將走向離婚。倘若離婚，洛麗有可能分得數百億美元財產，不過具體金額目前尚無定論。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585734.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.124929+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:26:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"0924e30aff5576077cf244b303a96cdda87cde081d277984881727c46d740304","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}